@startuml
scale max 2800 width
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false

title Activity Diagram WF-01 - B2B School Onboarding, Classroom Setup & Bulk Student Enrollment

|System Admin|
start
:Log in & provision new B2B School tenant;
:Select EnterprisePackage (SMALL / MEDIUM / LARGE)\n& set academic cycle (01/09 - 31/05);
:System creates School (status = ACTIVE)\nand initial School Admin account;

|School Admin|
:Log in & accept Local History Content Policy;
:Configure default daily student token quota;
:Create Teacher accounts & Classrooms\n(gradeLevel 6-12, academicYear);

|Teacher|
:Select target Classroom & upload Student Roster CSV;
:System validates CSV format, emails & studentCodes;
if (CSV rows valid?) then (Yes)
    :Create/Update School Student accounts\n(accountStatus = ACTIVE, mustChangePassword = true);
    :Create ClassStudent enrollment records;
    :Auto-mark pre-existing past-deadline assignments\nas EXEMPTED for newly enrolled students;
else (No)
    :Return row-level validation error report;
    stop
endif

|School Student|
:Log in with initial credentials;
:Complete mandatory first-login password change;
:Access assigned Classroom Dashboard;
stop
@enduml
